<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Afin</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Afin was the royal palace of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/alaafin">Alaafin</a>, the king of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/oyo-empire">Oyo Empire</a>, at the capital <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/oyo-ile">Oyo-Ile</a>. It was the seat from which the sacred king governed and the centre of court life and palace administration. The palace housed officials and royal servants who formed an important part of the Alaafin's power alongside the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/oyo-mesi">Oyo Mesi</a> council.</p></div>
